# `cargo openvm build` writes the transpiled .vmexe here (the default
# --output-dir, named after the CLI rather than chosen by us).
/openvm/

# openvm_init.rs is NOT ignored: it is generated from openvm.toml, but upstream
# tracks it for every guest crate, and committing it keeps a plain `cargo build`
# (and rust-analyzer) working without first running `cargo openvm build`.
